          },
          {
            "label": "Countdown everywhere",
            "value": "1"
          },
          {
            "label": "Off",
            "value": "0"
          }
        ],
        "description": "Automatic: a plain watch until the phone finds you near a transit centre the face knows; then the countdown to its next departure, and a flick of the wrist for the nearest stop. Countdown everywhere: the countdown wherever you are, set below. Off: a plain watch, and nothing is asked of the phone."
      },
      {
